    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis)" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis)" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a Verify at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (2)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "produced_by(codelogician)" at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (2)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    step the step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (2)" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a StateSpaceAnalysis at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (3)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "produced_by(codelogician)" at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (3)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    step the step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (3)" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician))" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
