the trace meets "the trace: it and every later step if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis and it and every later step if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) and it and every later step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    the trace meets "every step if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time.

when the session ends
    and it is not the case that the trace meets "the trace: it and every later step if it is a Formalize then it it or a later step is a Verify or is a StateSpaceAnalysis and it and every later step if it is a Verify then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) and it and every later step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysis then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)"
then the policy formalization_is_analyzed is broken.

% formalize_before_verify (error): (G(DefineVG → P_chain Formalize)) ∧ G(VerificationResult → (produced_by(codelogician) ∨ oracle_type(codelogician))) ∧ G(StateSpaceAnalysisResult → (produced_by(codelogician) ∨ oracle_type(codelogician))) ∧ G(ConformanceResult → (produced_by(codelogician) ∨ oracle_type(codelogician))) ∧ G(CoSimulationResult → (produced_by(codelogician) ∨ oracle_type(codelogician)))
% You cannot verify properties of code that hasn't been formalized into a model first.
step a step meets "if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a DefineVG at the time.

step a step meets "an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize" at a time if
    step a second step is in the chain of step the step at the time
    and step the second step was a Formalize at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize" at a time if
    step the step meets "an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize)" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize)" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a VerificationResult at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) (4)" at a time if
