the trace meets "the trace: it and every later step if it is a DefineVG then it an earlier step in its chain is a Formalize and it and every later step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) and it and every later step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) and it and every later step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician) and it and every later step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at a time if
