    and the trace meets "every step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(codelogician) or shows oracle_type(codelogician)" at the time
