    step the step meets "it or a later step shows ConformanceResult(passed)" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a Verify then it it or a later step shows ConformanceResult(passed))" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a Verify then it it or a later step shows ConformanceResult(passed)" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a Verify then it it or a later step shows ConformanceResult(passed))" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a Verify then it it or a later step shows ConformanceResult(passed))" at the time.

